    {
      "text": "Company introduction",
      "tag": "FONT",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144436",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "26px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "39px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "So how to define LBH",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144979",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "The trend leader in innovative products for personal care appliances",
      "tag": "FONT",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144983",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH Electric's entrepreneurial journey began in 2020. It is a technology company focusing on the design, development, manufacturing and sales of small personal care appliances with high-speed motor applications. We not only pursue the technological leadership of our products, but also pay more attention to design aesthetics and user experience, striving to make every product occupy a dominant position in the market. Since its establishment, LBH Electric has been leading the design trend and technological application innovation of personal care appliances, and is committed to creating the ultimate product experience - and will continue to do so in the future.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144982",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top brand partners",
      "tag": "FONT",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144984",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "30px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "45px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "We have established strategic cooperative relationships with suppliers and make full use of supply chain advantages to provide customers with better services; LBH Electric has established long-term partnerships with many world-renowned brands. Looking to the future, LBH Electric always adheres to the concept of \"only by being at the forefront of the market can we gain unparalleled advantages\", which makes us the best partner for many brands.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144985",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH Product Certification",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144207",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "How are we different?",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144987",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH Core Culture: Believe to See",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724145023",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relentlessly Pursuing Excellence",
      "tag": "FONT",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724145006",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Never be content with past achievements; maintaining our market-leading position requires the full commitment of every member of our team. Whenever there is an opportunity to do better, there is absolutely no reason for us to refuse to put in the extra effort.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724145005",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Be prepared to face any challenge.",
      "tag": "FONT",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724145007",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "We face challenges every day; the challenges of life are unpredictable, and all we can do is prepare ourselves—both mentally and emotionally. Whenever we encounter an obstacle, we must employ our wisdom to break it down, and then take action.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724145008",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Think and Do New Things",
      "tag": "FONT",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724145009",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "We deeply understand that without failure, there can be no innovation or creativity. Exploring the uncharted ocean requires not only a courageous seafaring crew but, more importantly, the audacity to venture toward unknown shores. At LBH Appliances, we cherish innovation and embrace the process—often filled with constructive conflict—that brings it to life.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724145011",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Only by focusing can you see the light.",
      "tag": "FONT",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724145010",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "No one shoots at a target with their eyes closed. Whenever you wish to achieve a goal, you must keep your eyes wide open, maintain your focus, and ensure you clearly understand exactly what you want. Concentrate on your objective—focus with the intensity of a laser beam. Ultimately, whatever we focus on will grow.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724145012",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Our Mission",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144989",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Create a Platform for Outstanding Employees",
      "tag": "STRONG",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144504",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH Appliances is a company committed to fostering the growth of its employees and sharing opportunities for advancement; whenever an opportunity for professional development arises, we spare no effort to make it a reality.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144503",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Creating Value for Our Trusted Clients",
      "tag": "STRONG",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144505",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Customer interests take precedence over all else. LBH Appliances consistently views matters from the customer's perspective, continuously strives to enhance customer satisfaction, and is dedicated to building long-term, mutually trusting, and meaningful customer relationships.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144508",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
